WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.273
- Hello.
- Are we just starting?

00:00:02.273 --> 00:00:04.356
- Welcome to our TV show.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.963
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.295 --> 00:00:10.836
- (bleep), marry or kill?

00:00:10.836 --> 00:00:13.419
Pizza, alcohol, John Krasinski.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.559
- (laughing) Pizza, alcohol.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:17.684
I would (bleep) a pizza.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.517
- Me, too.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:19.516
- I would marry John Krasinski.

00:00:19.516 --> 00:00:20.349
- Me, too.

00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:21.231
- 'Cuz he's a sweetheart.
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:21.231 --> 00:00:22.139
- And I'd kill alcohol.
- Yep.

00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:24.163
- Have you ever pretended you weren't

00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:25.782
Kristen Wiig when asked?

00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:26.624
- All the time.

00:00:26.624 --> 00:00:27.799
Instead of recognizing me,

00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:29.515
they always tell me I
look like Kristin Wiig

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:30.875
or like I look like someone

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.649
that was like on SNL or something.

00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:34.753
And then I just say, "Oh yeah,
I get that all the time."

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:36.706
- I was on vacation with my family

00:00:36.706 --> 00:00:38.839
and a woman came up to me.

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:43.491
The woman said, "Hi, can I
find a picture of Ben Stiller?"

00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:46.989
(Kristen laughing)
(romantic music)

00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:50.510
And I was like, "No, I'm not Ben Stiller."

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:53.914
- Do you do any vocal
exercises to help prepare

00:00:53.914 --> 00:00:55.743
your voice before scenes?

00:00:55.743 --> 00:00:57.521
- Yes, I do!

00:00:57.521 --> 00:00:58.547
(Kristen laughing)

00:00:58.547 --> 00:01:00.432
No, what I generally do is just come in,

00:01:00.432 --> 00:01:02.592
do all of the screaming first,

00:01:02.592 --> 00:01:05.450
so by the end of a five
or six hour session,

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:06.783
there's nothing there.

00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:07.616
- Wait, for real?

00:01:07.616 --> 00:01:08.449
- No.
- Oh.

00:01:08.449 --> 00:01:10.052
- Do you and your character in the movie

00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:11.383
have anything in common?

00:01:11.383 --> 00:01:13.628
- Real skinny legs (chuckling).

00:01:13.628 --> 00:01:15.082
I'm just kidding.

00:01:15.082 --> 00:01:16.439
We both drive.

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:18.243
- Are you a spy?

00:01:18.243 --> 00:01:19.228
- No.

00:01:19.228 --> 00:01:21.800
- Hmm. (Kristen chuckling)

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.084
- [Kristen] Have you ever
used your celebrity status

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.803
to get you into something?

00:01:25.803 --> 00:01:27.279
- Yes, all the time, it's all I do.

00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:30.534
But, more importantly,
the look on someone's face

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:33.068
when they know that they aren't

00:01:33.068 --> 00:01:36.640
as important as you are is priceless.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:37.571
I love it!

00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:39.249
What's your craziest tabloid rumor

00:01:39.249 --> 00:01:41.119
that you have ever read about yourself?

00:01:41.119 --> 00:01:42.717
- Oh, my God, they're all crazy!

00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:45.694
I went to a restaurant
with my friend's parents

00:01:45.694 --> 00:01:47.661
and it was very loud for them,

00:01:47.661 --> 00:01:49.263
so we asked to move.

00:01:49.263 --> 00:01:53.780
According to the papers, I hated
my seat, (thunder crashing)

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.029
so I asked to be moved three times

00:01:56.029 --> 00:01:57.930
and I left my bag at the table.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.944
And when they returned it to
me, I yelled at the manager

00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:01.787
and told them it was their fault.

00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:03.273
(both laughing)

00:02:03.273 --> 00:02:05.728
They just make shit (bleep) up, stuff up.

00:02:05.728 --> 00:02:07.083
(both laughing)

00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:08.557
- Be careful what you say.

00:02:08.557 --> 00:02:10.722
- And what you read.
- It can have consequences.

00:02:10.722 --> 00:02:11.808
- And what you spread.

00:02:11.808 --> 00:02:14.391
(upbeat music)

